B.az2=s(["Stargazing picnic with blankets, thermoses, and a constellation app.","Couples pottery or paint-and-sip night \u2014 laugh at the masterpieces.","Sunset kayak or paddleboat if you are both comfortable on water.","Dress up for dinner at a place with live acoustic music.","Home movie marathon: their pick, your pick, popcorn, dim lights.","Botanical garden walk with a camera and zero rush.","Rooftop or hilltop picnic at golden hour with sparkling juice.","Dance class intro: salsa, bachata, or swing \u2014 beginners welcome.","Visit a museum and choose one artwork that represents your mood.","Cook a new recipe together \u2014 assign roles: chef and sous-chef.","Ice skating or roller skating \u2014 hold on if balance needs help.","Book a couples massage or spa half-day for deep calm.","Drive to a small town you have never explored; caf\xe9 hop once there.","Build a blanket fort at home with fairy lights and playlists.","Volunteer together for a few hours \u2014 shared purpose bonds hearts.","Arcade date: playful competition, share tickets for a silly prize.","Wine-free vineyard tour or orchard visit in harvest season.","Photography walk: capture ten things that feel like \u201cus.\u201d","Attend a local theater play or improv show \u2014 shared laughter.","Plan a breakfast-in-bed surprise on a lazy weekend.","Take a scenic train or ferry ride with no destination pressure.","Visit an aquarium or planetarium \u2014 wonder feels romantic.","Host a fondue night: chocolate or cheese, choose your adventure.","Go thrifting and pick one outfit piece for each other.","Write wishes on paper lanterns or jars and read them aloud.","Plan a \u201cyes day\u201d with a small budget and big imagination.","Rent bikes and explore a trail ending at a lakeside bench.","Couples yoga or stretching session \u2014 gentle, grounding.","Attend a food festival and share every bite.","Set up a backyard fire pit with s\u2019mores and old stories.","Take a cooking class: pasta, sushi, or desserts.","Plan a surprise day trip to a waterfall or scenic overlook.","Visit a Christmas market or seasonal fair hand in hand.","Record a short video diary of your date \u2014 memory for later.","Book a cozy cabin or boutique hotel for one night away.","Go to a jazz lounge with mocktails if you prefer no alcohol.","Create a scavenger hunt with inside jokes as clues.","Plant something together \u2014 herbs, flowers, a tree if allowed.","Attend a poetry open mic and dedicate a line to them afterward.","Plan a themed dinner at home: Paris, Tokyo, or their dream city.","Watch the sunrise with hot drinks and silence first, words second.","Visit a cat caf\xe9 or animal shelter visit if you love gentle creatures.","Go bowling or mini-golf \u2014 playful rivalry, sweet truce.","Take a pottery mug home and use it on your next coffee date.","Plan a photo-book page of your favorite moments together.","Attend a lantern festival or night market with matching colors.","Write love letters and exchange them to open on a future date.","Plan a stargazing drive with their favorite snacks in the trunk.","Recreate your first meeting place with a small upgrade: better dessert.","End the night saying what you are grateful for about them \u2014 specific beats generic."],t.s)
